WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.359 --> 00:00:02.925
RUSSIA AS WELL.

00:00:02.926 --> 00:00:04.960
&gt;&gt; Bret: OKAY, JOHN,

00:00:04.961 --> 00:00:05.394
THANK YOU.

00:00:05.395 --> 00:00:06.829
SPEAKING OF THAT, LET'S GET THE

00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:08.797
LATEST ON THE SITUATION RIGHT

00:00:08.798 --> 00:00:10.199
NOW FROM SECRETARY OF STATE MIKE

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:10.532
POMPEO.

00:00:10.533 --> 00:00:12.601
HE JOINS US FROM THE

00:00:12.602 --> 00:00:13.102
STATE DEPARTMENT.

00:00:13.103 --> 00:00:14.036
MR. SECRETARY, THANK YOU FOR

00:00:14.037 --> 00:00:14.803
BEING HERE.

00:00:14.804 --> 00:00:16.238
&gt;&gt; BRET, GREAT TO BE HERE.

00:00:16.239 --> 00:00:18.273
&gt;&gt; Bret: I HEARD AN INTERVIEW,

00:00:18.274 --> 00:00:19.141
YOU SAID THAT NICOLAS MADURO WAS

00:00:19.142 --> 00:00:20.809
ON HIS WAY OUT, PLANNING TO

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:22.444
LEAVE BY PLAINTIFF HAVANA, CUBA.

00:00:22.445 --> 00:00:24.413
HOW CLOSE DID HE GET?

00:00:24.414 --> 00:00:25.748
&gt;&gt; UNDERSTANDING THAT HE WAS

00:00:25.749 --> 00:00:28.384
READY TO GO, HE MADE A DECISION

00:00:28.385 --> 00:00:29.585
THAT WE HAD BEEN URGING THEM TO

00:00:29.586 --> 00:00:32.388
MAKE FOR QUITE SOME TIME, HE WAS

00:00:32.389 --> 00:00:35.758
DIVERTED FROM THAT ACTION BY THE

00:00:35.759 --> 00:00:36.425
RUSSIANS.

00:00:36.426 --> 00:00:37.226
WE HOPE HE WILL RECONSIDER AND

00:00:37.227 --> 00:00:38.394
GET BACK ON THE PLANE.

00:00:38.395 --> 00:00:40.429
WE'VE MADE IT VERY CLEAR, WE

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:43.432
SUPPORT THE NATIONAL SO TO

00:00:43.433 --> 00:00:44.600
ASSEMBLY, THERE INTERIM

00:00:44.601 --> 00:00:46.535
PRESIDENT JUAN GUAIDO, AND WE AR

00:00:46.536 --> 00:00:48.437
PRESIDENT JUAN GUAIDO, AND WE AE

00:00:48.438 --> 00:00:48.470
PRESIDENT JUAN GUAIDO, AND WE AS

00:00:48.471 --> 00:00:48.504
PRESIDENT JUAN GUAIDO, AND WE AP

00:00:48.505 --> 00:00:48.537
PRESIDENT JUAN GUAIDO, AND WE AO

00:00:48.538 --> 00:00:48.570
PRESIDENT JUAN GUAIDO, AND WE AT

00:00:48.571 --> 00:00:48.604
PRESIDENT JUAN GUAIDO, AND WE AN

00:00:48.605 --> 00:00:48.971
PRESIDENT JUAN GUAIDO, AND WE AG

00:00:48.972 --> 00:00:49.004
PRESIDENT JUAN GUAIDO, AND WE AT

00:00:49.005 --> 00:00:49.405
PRESIDENT JUAN GUAIDO, AND WE AE

00:00:49.406 --> 00:00:49.438
PRESIDENT JUAN GUAIDO, AND WE AV

00:00:49.439 --> 00:00:49.471
PRESIDENT JUAN GUAIDO, AND WE AN

00:00:49.472 --> 00:00:49.505
PRESIDENT JUAN GUAIDO, AND WE AZ

00:00:49.506 --> 00:00:49.538
PRESIDENT JUAN GUAIDO, AND WE AE

00:00:49.539 --> 00:00:49.571
PRESIDENT JUAN GUAIDO, AND WE AA

00:00:49.572 --> 00:00:49.872
PRESIDENT JUAN GUAIDO, AND WE AN

00:00:49.873 --> 00:00:50.673
PEOPLE, IT IS TIME TO BUILD BACK

00:00:50.674 --> 00:00:53.175
THEIR ECONOMY SO THAT STARVING

00:00:53.176 --> 00:00:54.510
CHILDREN AND THOSE THAT ARE SICK

00:00:54.511 --> 00:00:55.744
CAN GET MEDICINE THAT IS SITTING

00:00:55.745 --> 00:00:56.478
ON THE NATION'S BORDER.

00:00:56.479 --> 00:00:58.180
&gt;&gt; Bret: WOULD HE HAVE A SAFE

00:00:58.181 --> 00:01:00.416
PASSAGE TO HAVANA IF HE GOT ON

00:01:00.417 --> 00:01:00.816
THAT PLANE?

00:01:00.817 --> 00:01:03.719
&gt;&gt; WE'VE MADE VERY CLEAR WHAT

00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:06.789
THE EXPECTATIONS FOR MADURO'S

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:08.991
DEPARTURE, FOR THE DEPARTURES OF

00:01:08.992 --> 00:01:10.159
OTHER, TOO, AND WHAT HER

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:11.093
EXPECTATIONS, ASSURANCES WE ARE

00:01:11.094 --> 00:01:13.362
WILLING TO PROVIDE, I WILL

00:01:13.363 --> 00:01:14.630
NOT DISCUSS THOSE HERE.

00:01:14.631 --> 00:01:17.066
&gt;&gt; Bret: BUT LIVING IS ONE OF

00:01:17.067 --> 00:01:17.366
THEM?

00:01:17.367 --> 00:01:18.667
&gt;&gt; BRET, I'M NOT GOING TO START

00:01:18.668 --> 00:01:20.202
DOWN THAT PATH FOR YOU.

00:01:20.203 --> 00:01:21.937
&gt;&gt; Bret: OKAY, WHAT ABOUT THE

00:01:21.938 --> 00:01:22.638
RUSSIANS?

00:01:22.639 --> 00:01:24.373
HAS BEEN COMMUNICATIONS WITH THE

00:01:24.374 --> 00:01:25.708
RUSSIANS SINCE THEY TOLD HIM TO

00:01:25.709 --> 00:01:27.776
STAY IN CARACAS?

00:01:27.777 --> 00:01:29.445
&gt;&gt; BRET, I DON'T WANT TO GET

00:01:29.446 --> 00:01:30.679
INTO ALL THE CONVERSATIONS WE

00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:31.080
HAVE TODAY.

00:01:31.081 --> 00:01:33.749
BUT IT'S VERY CLEAR.

00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:34.516
THE CUBANS AND THE RUSSIANS

00:01:34.517 --> 00:01:36.919
UNDERSTAND THAT THEY ARE

00:01:36.920 --> 00:01:38.253
UPSETTING THE DULY ELECTED

00:01:38.254 --> 00:01:39.254
LEADER THERE IN VENEZUELA.

00:01:39.255 --> 00:01:40.522
THEY KNOW THAT.

00:01:40.523 --> 00:01:42.624
I HEAR SOMETIMES PEOPLE SAY,

00:01:42.625 --> 00:01:43.592
WELL, THE UNITED STATES IS

00:01:43.593 --> 00:01:45.227
CONSIDERING AN INVASION.

00:01:45.228 --> 00:01:46.895
THE INVASION HAS TAKEN PLACE.

00:01:46.896 --> 00:01:48.497
THE CUBANS HAVE THOUSANDS OF

00:01:48.498 --> 00:01:49.865
THEIR OFFICERS INSIDE OF THE

00:01:49.866 --> 00:01:50.365
VENEZUELA TODAY.

00:01:50.366 --> 00:01:52.434
THEY ARE NOT THERE WITH THE

00:01:52.435 --> 00:01:53.202
CONSENT OF THE GOVERNMENT.

00:01:53.203 --> 00:01:55.904
THEY ARE THERE WITH THE CONSENT

00:01:55.905 --> 00:01:56.805
OF NICOLAS MADURO.

00:01:56.806 --> 00:01:58.774
NOT JUAN GUAIDO, THE DULY

00:01:58.775 --> 00:01:59.541
ELECTED LEADER OF THE VENEZUELAN

00:01:59.542 --> 00:02:01.176
GOVERNMENT TODAY.

00:02:01.177 --> 00:02:03.045
FOR THE RUSSIANS, IT'S THE SAME.

00:02:03.046 --> 00:02:05.314
IT IS TIME FOR MADURO TO LEAVE,

00:02:05.315 --> 00:02:06.815
TIME FOR THEM TO HAVE FREE AND

00:02:06.816 --> 00:02:08.817
FAIR ELECTIONS, TIME TO REBUILD

00:02:08.818 --> 00:02:10.052
THIS ONCE GREAT ECONOMY.

00:02:10.053 --> 00:02:11.019
&gt;&gt; Bret: YOU ARE TALKING ABOUT

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:11.754
CUBA AND RUSSIA.

00:02:11.755 --> 00:02:15.824
YOU HAVE, AS YOU LOOK AT THE MAP

00:02:15.825 --> 00:02:16.492
HERE, 45 NATIONS AROUND THE

00:02:16.493 --> 00:02:18.260
WORLD HAVE RECOGNIZED GUAIDO AS

00:02:18.261 --> 00:02:19.394
THE LEADER OF VENEZUELA,

00:02:19.395 --> 00:02:20.596
INCLUDING THE U.S.

00:02:20.597 --> 00:02:22.498
BUT THERE ARE 14 COUNTRIES THAT

00:02:22.499 --> 00:02:24.666
CONTINUE TO SUPPORT MADURO,

00:02:24.667 --> 00:02:26.935
RUSSIA, CHINA, TURKEY, CUBA,

00:02:26.936 --> 00:02:30.439
BOLIVIA, IRAN, NICARAGUA,

00:02:30.440 --> 00:02:31.874
URUGUAY, SYRIA, BELARUS,

00:02:31.875 --> 00:02:32.841
SOUTH AFRICA, CAMBODIA, AND

00:02:32.842 --> 00:02:33.242
NORTH KOREA.

00:02:33.243 --> 00:02:34.510
ARE YOU TURNING THE SCREWS ON

00:02:34.511 --> 00:02:36.111
THESE COUNTRIES?

00:02:36.112 --> 00:02:38.313
HOW IS THAT PRESSURE BUILDING TO

00:02:38.314 --> 00:02:38.881
ACCEPT GUAIDO?

00:02:38.882 --> 00:02:39.982
&gt;&gt; THE STATE DEPARTMENT HAS BEEN

00:02:39.983 --> 00:02:40.516
HARD AT THIS.

00:02:40.517 --> 00:02:44.286
WE ARE UP OVER 50 NATIONS, 54 OR

00:02:44.287 --> 00:02:45.053
56 NATIONS THAT ARE SUPPORTING

00:02:45.054 --> 00:02:47.256
JUAN GUAIDO.

00:02:47.257 --> 00:02:49.224
WE ARE HAPPY TO HAVE THE 57TH

00:02:49.225 --> 00:02:49.858
THE MOMENT WE CAN GET AT.

00:02:49.859 --> 00:02:50.526
WE HAVE MADE CLEAR TO THE

00:02:50.527 --> 00:02:51.727
NATIONS THAT YOU JUST CALLED

00:02:51.728 --> 00:02:53.595
OUT, WE'VE MADE CLEAR TO THEM,

00:02:53.596 --> 00:02:55.063
THEY ARE THE WRONG SIDE OF

00:02:55.064 --> 00:02:55.430
HISTORY.

00:02:55.431 --> 00:02:56.198
THE RULE OF LAW AND DEMOCRACY

00:02:56.199 --> 00:02:59.935
ARE TO BE RESTORED.

00:02:59.936 --> 00:03:01.303
THE DESTRUCTION THAT HAS TAKEN

00:03:01.304 --> 00:03:02.538
PLACE OVER YEARS INSIDE OF

00:03:02.539 --> 00:03:03.405
VENEZUELA WILL BE A STRUGGLE TO

00:03:03.406 --> 00:03:05.808
REBUILD BUT IT IS A WORTHY

00:03:05.809 --> 00:03:08.544
CAUSE, AND NICOLAS MADURO CANNOT

00:03:08.545 --> 00:03:10.179
BE ANYWHERE IN THE COUNTRY IF

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:10.913
THE VENEZUELAN PEOPLE HELP TO

00:03:10.914 --> 00:03:12.848
FINALLY ACHIEVE THAT OUTCOME.

00:03:12.849 --> 00:03:13.649
I'M CONFIDENT THEY WILL GET

00:03:13.650 --> 00:03:17.085
THERE AND THE UNITED STATES, THE

00:03:17.086 --> 00:03:18.620
LIMA GROUP, COUNTRIES IN THE

00:03:18.621 --> 00:03:20.355
REGION, THE ORGANIZATION, THEY

00:03:20.356 --> 00:03:22.124
ARE ALL SUPPORTING NOT.

00:03:22.125 --> 00:03:22.791
&gt;&gt; Bret: YOU MENTIONED THAT

00:03:22.792 --> 00:03:25.460
SOME IN THE MADURO REGIME TALK

00:03:25.461 --> 00:03:28.263
ABOUT THE U.S. POSSIBLY INVADING

00:03:28.264 --> 00:03:28.630
VENEZUELA.

00:03:28.631 --> 00:03:29.932
ONE OF THOSE WAS THE AMBASSADOR

00:03:29.933 --> 00:03:31.300
TO THE U.N. FOR VENEZUELA, WHO

00:03:31.301 --> 00:03:34.036
SAID THAT THE BUILDUP IN THE

00:03:34.037 --> 00:03:36.038
EMBASSY IN BOGOTA COLUMBIA NEXT

00:03:36.039 --> 00:03:38.106
DOOR HAS BEEN TO GET READY

00:03:38.107 --> 00:03:38.574
FOR WAR.

00:03:38.575 --> 00:03:39.275
LESSONS INTO THIS

00:03:42.412 --> 00:03:46.248
&gt;&gt; THE PLAN, 3,000 OFFICERS,

00:03:46.249 --> 00:03:47.115
3,000 TRAINERS, 3,000

00:03:47.116 --> 00:03:49.184
TECHNICIANS, 3,000 INFORMATION

00:03:49.185 --> 00:03:52.521
TECHNICIANS, IT'S A WAR EMBASSY.

00:03:52.522 --> 00:03:53.789
SHOW ME WHERE IN THE WORLD THERE

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:56.024
ARE MORE THAN 3,000 AMERICANS IN

00:03:56.025 --> 00:03:56.859
ONE EMBASSY.

00:03:56.860 --> 00:04:01.129
SO THEY ARE PLANNING FOR WAR.

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:04.466
LET'S TAKE OFF THE BLINDFOLD AND

00:04:04.467 --> 00:04:05.100
LOOK AT THE REALITY AS IT

00:04:05.101 --> 00:04:06.902
ACTUALLY IS.

00:04:06.903 --> 00:04:08.770
&gt;&gt; Bret: WHAT IS A RESPONSE

00:04:08.771 --> 00:04:10.539
WITHOUT, AS WE LOOK AT LIVE

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:11.740
PICTURES IN CARACAS,

00:04:11.741 --> 00:04:12.374
MR. SECRETARY?

00:04:12.375 --> 00:04:13.909
&gt;&gt; WE NEVER TALK ABOUT THE

00:04:13.910 --> 00:04:16.011
NUMBERS WE HAVE AT ANY

00:04:16.012 --> 00:04:16.545
PARTICULAR EMBASSY.

00:04:16.546 --> 00:04:19.581
THEY CHANGE FROM DAY-TO-DAY.

00:04:19.582 --> 00:04:22.551
BUT IF THE QUESTION IS, IS THE

00:04:22.552 --> 00:04:23.185
UNITED STATES PREPARED TO

00:04:23.186 --> 00:04:24.987
CONSIDER MILITARY ACTION IF THAT

00:04:24.988 --> 00:04:27.089
IS WHAT IT TAKES TO RESTORE THE

00:04:27.090 --> 00:04:28.991
DEMOCRACY THEY ARE IN VENEZUELA,

00:04:28.992 --> 00:04:30.626
THE PRESIDENT HAS BEEN

00:04:30.627 --> 00:04:31.260
CONSISTENT AND UNAMBIGUOUS

00:04:31.261 --> 00:04:32.394
ABOUT THAT.

00:04:32.395 --> 00:04:34.429
THE OPTION TO USE MILITARY FORCE

00:04:34.430 --> 00:04:35.964
IS AVAILABLE IF THAT IS WHAT IS

00:04:35.965 --> 00:04:36.531
ULTIMATELY CALLED FOR.

00:04:36.532 --> 00:04:37.399
WE HOPE IT'S NOT.

00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:39.234
WE HOPE THERE CAN BE A PEACEFUL

00:04:39.235 --> 00:04:40.102
RESOLUTION AND THAT MADURO WILL

00:04:40.103 --> 00:04:41.536
LEAVE WITHOUT VIOLENCE.

00:04:41.537 --> 00:04:43.071
WE ARE WATCHING THOSE WHO ARE

00:04:43.072 --> 00:04:44.239
ENGAGED IN VIOLENCE AND WE WILL

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:45.607
HOLD THEM ACCOUNTABLE.

00:04:45.608 --> 00:04:46.875
THE PRESIDENT HAS MADE VERY,

00:04:46.876 --> 00:04:49.611
VERY CLEAR THAT WE WILL ENSURE

00:04:49.612 --> 00:04:51.580
THE VENEZUELAN DEMOCRACY IS

00:04:51.581 --> 00:04:51.947
RESTORED.

00:04:51.948 --> 00:04:52.681
&gt;&gt; Bret: NICOLAS MADURO ISSUED

00:04:52.682 --> 00:04:54.783
A TWEET TODAY AND HE SAID NERVES

00:04:54.784 --> 00:04:57.586
OF STEEL, SPOKEN TO ALL

00:04:57.587 --> 00:04:58.353
COMMANDERS IN THE INTEGRAL

00:04:58.354 --> 00:05:00.022
DEFENSE REGIONS AND INTEGRAL

00:05:00.023 --> 00:05:01.323
DEFENSE OWNS AROUND THE COUNTRY,

00:05:01.324 --> 00:05:02.925
WHO HAVE PLEDGED THEIR TOTAL

00:05:02.926 --> 00:05:04.893
LOYALTY TO THE PEOPLE OF THE

00:05:04.894 --> 00:05:06.762
CONSTITUTION AND THEIR

00:05:06.763 --> 00:05:07.162
FATHERLAND.

00:05:07.163 --> 00:05:07.763
CALL FOR MAXIMUM POPULAR

00:05:07.764 --> 00:05:08.830
MOBILIZATION TO ASSURE THE

00:05:08.831 --> 00:05:10.065
VICTORY OF PEACE.

00:05:10.066 --> 00:05:11.667
WE WILL WIN."

00:05:11.668 --> 00:05:12.367
MR. SECRETARY, THAT DOES NOT

00:05:12.368 --> 00:05:13.835
SOUND LIKE A GUY THAT IS GETTING

00:05:13.836 --> 00:05:14.970
READY TO LEAVE.

00:05:14.971 --> 00:05:16.405
&gt;&gt; NERVES OF STEEL HASN'T SHOWN

00:05:16.406 --> 00:05:18.473
US ALL VERY MUCH TODAY, BRET.

00:05:18.474 --> 00:05:20.409
WHILE ONE WIDEOUT IS OUT TALKING

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:22.144
TO THE PEOPLE OF VENEZUELA, HE'S

00:05:22.145 --> 00:05:23.712
ON THE STREETS SHAKING

00:05:23.713 --> 00:05:31.420
HANDS, RALLYING, WHILE NICOLAS

00:05:31.421 --> 00:05:32.120
MADURO HAS BEEN HIDING FOR THE

00:05:32.121 --> 00:05:32.487
WHOLE DAY.

00:05:32.488 --> 00:05:33.188
SO MUCH FOR NERVES OF STEEL.

00:05:33.189 --> 00:05:33.889
&gt;&gt; Bret: AS WE ARE CONTINUING

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:34.589
TO LOOK LIVE THERE, WERE YOU

00:05:34.590 --> 00:05:35.557
TAKEN BY SURPRISE THAT IT

00:05:35.558 --> 00:05:36.825
HAPPENED ON THIS DAY AND NOT

00:05:36.826 --> 00:05:37.192
TOMORROW?

00:05:37.193 --> 00:05:40.362
&gt;&gt; WE'VE BEEN WORKING TO RESTORE

00:05:40.363 --> 00:05:41.129
DEMOCRACY FOR MONTHS.

00:05:41.130 --> 00:05:42.965
AS EVENTS UNFOLD DAY-TO-DAY, YOU

00:05:42.966 --> 00:05:44.066
CAN NEVER PREDICT WHICH WAY IN

00:05:44.067 --> 00:05:47.569
PARTICULAR DAYS WILL HAPPEN.

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:48.570
WE HAD KNOWN THERE WOULD ALWAYS

00:05:48.571 --> 00:05:49.538
BE SOMEBODY THAT LOOKED ABOUT

00:05:49.539 --> 00:05:52.908
LIKE TODAY IN THE SENSE THAT THE

00:05:52.909 --> 00:05:53.809
INCREASING OPPORTUNITIES FOR

00:05:53.810 --> 00:05:55.744
VENEZUELAN DEMOCRACY, WE ARE

00:05:55.745 --> 00:05:56.411
CONTINUING TO SUPPORT THAT

00:05:56.412 --> 00:05:56.745
EFFORT.

00:05:56.746 --> 00:05:58.246
&gt;&gt; Bret: IS THERE A REDLINE IN

00:05:58.247 --> 00:06:03.418
VENEZUELA IF MADURO DOES NEXT,

00:06:03.419 --> 00:06:04.052
THE U.S. DOES SOMETHING?

00:06:04.053 --> 00:06:06.021
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE PLANNED OUT LOTS OF

00:06:06.022 --> 00:06:07.456
OPTIONS, WE ARE PREPARED FOR

00:06:07.457 --> 00:06:08.256
LOTS OF THINGS.

00:06:08.257 --> 00:06:10.392
I DON'T WANT TO TALK ABOUT WHAT

00:06:10.393 --> 00:06:11.593
PARTICULAR ACTIONS MAY TRIGGER

00:06:11.594 --> 00:06:12.160
PARTICULAR RESPONSES.

00:06:12.161 --> 00:06:12.928
THE PRESIDENT JUST TALKED ABOUT

00:06:12.929 --> 00:06:15.063
THE NEED FOR THE CUBANS TO

00:06:15.064 --> 00:06:16.064
CHANGE THEIR WAYS AND WHAT WE

00:06:16.065 --> 00:06:18.367
WILL DO IF THE CUBANS MAKE A

00:06:18.368 --> 00:06:19.801
DECISION TO CONTINUE TO ENGAGE

00:06:19.802 --> 00:06:21.269
IN VIOLENCE TO TAKE DOWN THE

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:23.171
DULY ELECTED LEADERSHIP IN

00:06:23.172 --> 00:06:23.572
VENEZUELA.

00:06:23.573 --> 00:06:25.774
BEYOND THAT, I DON'T WANT TO GET

00:06:25.775 --> 00:06:27.309
INTO WHAT PARTICULAR LINES ARE.

00:06:27.310 --> 00:06:29.177
THE VENEZUELAN PEOPLE SHOULD

00:06:29.178 --> 00:06:30.946
KNOW, NOT JUST THE

00:06:30.947 --> 00:06:32.881
UNITED STATES, BUT 50 PLUS

00:06:32.882 --> 00:06:33.582
COUNTRIES, ORGANIZATION OF THE

00:06:33.583 --> 00:06:37.052
AMERICAN STATES ARE CONTINUED TO

00:06:37.053 --> 00:06:38.954
STAND WITH THEM.

00:06:38.955 --> 00:06:39.621
&gt;&gt; Bret: MR. SECRETARY, TWO

00:06:39.622 --> 00:06:40.522
MORE QUESTIONS.

00:06:40.523 --> 00:06:41.390
NORTH KOREA, THE NORTH KOREANS

00:06:41.391 --> 00:06:43.392
SAYING THEY NEEDS TO BE A NEW

00:06:43.393 --> 00:06:44.459
APPROACH TO DENUCLEARIZATION.

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:46.428
ARE YOU STILL HOPEFUL THAT THAT

00:06:46.429 --> 00:06:47.963
NEEDS TO COME TOGETHER, SEEING

00:06:47.964 --> 00:06:48.730
WHAT YOU SEE NOW?

00:06:48.731 --> 00:06:50.799
&gt;&gt; I AM, I STILL REMAIN HELPFUL.

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:52.334
THERE IS ONLY ONE REAL APPROACH

00:06:52.335 --> 00:06:54.503
TO DO NUCLEAR RADIATION, THAT IS

00:06:54.504 --> 00:06:55.170
TO DENUCLEARIZE.

00:06:55.171 --> 00:06:57.105
TO BEGIN TO TAKE DOWN THE

00:06:57.106 --> 00:06:57.973
THREAT.

00:06:57.974 --> 00:07:00.509
WE ARE PREPARED TO ENGAGE IN

00:07:00.510 --> 00:07:03.145
CONVERSATIONS TO ARRIVE AT A

00:07:03.146 --> 00:07:03.979
PROCESS, BY WHICH THE

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:05.313
NORTH KOREANS CAN SEE THERE WERE

00:07:05.314 --> 00:07:06.515
A CLEAR FULFILLING THE

00:07:06.516 --> 00:07:07.649
COMMITMENT THAT CHAIRMAN KIM

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:09.217
